# @APP_NAME@

@APP_NAME@ is an independent Umicom Framework application generated by the
native `umicom` command.

## Architecture

- `framework/` is the shared Umicom Framework Git submodule.
- `applications/@APP_SLUG@/` contains product identity and domain behaviour.
- Reusable platform capabilities remain in Framework.
- Product-specific GTK4 composition remains in the application.

## Configure, build and test

```powershell
umicom check --gtk
umicom make
```

## Application identity

- ID: `@APP_ID@`
- Frontends: console=@ENABLE_CONSOLE@, gtk=@ENABLE_GTK@, web=@ENABLE_WEB@
- Framework link: `@FRAMEWORK_MODE@`
